G3D's MSVC port of libzip 0.9, taken from G3D's bundled zip.lib (g3d SVN r100, zip.lib/source and
include): config.h (no HAVE_MKSTEMP/HAVE_FSEEKO under _MSC_VER), zipint.h (ZIP_EXTERN empty, mode_t,
strcasecmp=_stricmp, snprintf=_snprintf), zip.h (ssize_t=SSIZE_T) and mkstemp.c (_mktemp + _open).
Build need for VC9; PLAYER evidence: '%s.XXXXXX' at 0x00bc0334 (zip_close temp name) and the
_zip_mkstemp body, see the match CSV.

